# Zellij Theme KDL Schema

## File Location
Store custom themes in `CONFIG_DIR/themes/` directory. Find the exact path with `zellij setup --check`.

## KDL Structure

Based on the documentation provided, the complete theme structure is:

```kdl
themes {
    your_theme_name {
        text_unselected {
            base 0 0 0
            background 255 153 0
            emphasis_0 255 53 94
            emphasis_1 255 255 255
            emphasis_2 0 217 227
            emphasis_3 255 0 255
        }
        text_selected { /* same structure */ }
        ribbon_unselected { /* same structure */ }
        ribbon_selected { /* same structure */ }
        table_title { /* same structure */ }
        table_cell_unselected { /* same structure */ }
        table_cell_selected { /* same structure */ }
        list_unselected { /* same structure */ }
        list_selected { /* same structure */ }
        frame_unselected { /* same structure */ }
        frame_selected { /* same structure */ }
        frame_highlight { /* same structure */ }
        exit_code_success { /* base only */ }
        exit_code_error { /* base only */ }

        multiplayer_user_colors {
            player_1 255 0 255
            player_2 0 217 227
            player_3 0
            /* ... up to player_10 */
        }
    }
}
```

## Color Format

Per the documentation, colors use: `"space separated list of three numbers representing the RGB color"`. Only **RGB tuples** (0-255 values) are documented; hex, 256-color, or named formats are not mentioned in this guide.

